# Build context of apps/server/Dockerfile (the repository root). The image installs and builds
# from source, so nothing built or installed locally is sent, and neither are local databases,
# secrets or history. deploy/Dockerfile uses deploy/ as its context, with its own .dockerignore.
.git
.github
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.vite
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/.pnpm-store
packages/assembly/build

# Local databases (the server's SQLite file and its WAL and shared-memory files).
**/*.db
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3

# Secrets and editor droppings.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/token
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/.DS_Store
